@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

participant "command:AddDogCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> Command : execute(model)
note over Command
  The parser has supplied an unassigned Dog.
end note
Command -> Model : hasDog(dog)
Model --> Command : false
Command -> Model : addDog(dog)
note right of Model
  Delegates to WatchDog.addDog(dog),
  which assigns the persistent ID.
  Refreshes displayed records.
end note
Model --> Command : addedDog
note over Command
  Builds feedback using addedDog,
  including its assigned ID.
end note
[<-- Command : commandResult

legend bottom
  Adds a dog; Model internals are omitted.
  Parsing and saving follow the shared Logic flow.
  Successful execution only; validation failures are omitted.
endlegend
@enduml
